OL,4,BSams to return to Somerset for 2027    
OL,5,BT20 Blast                              
OL,6,GSomerset have agreed a deal to bring   
OL,7,Gback Australia seamer Daniel Sams for  
OL,8,Gthe 2027 T20 Blast campaign.           
OL,10,FThe 34-year-old took 20 wickets at an  
OL,11,Faverage of 19.15 last season as he     
OL,12,Fhelped Somerset reach the semi-finals  
OL,13,Fof the competition.                    
OL,15,FHe was the Blast's Most Valuable       
OL,16,FPlayer in 2023 while playing for Essex 
OL,17,Fand has also played in the Indian      
OL,18,FPremier League and Australia's Big     
OL,19,FBash.                                  
